# Third-party skill bundles vendored into agents/skills.
# Applied by scripts/agents/vendor_skills.sh; pins recorded in skills.lock.
#
# Directives (whitespace separated, # comments allowed):
#   source <id> <git-url> <ref>          a repo to pull from
#   skill  <id> <path-glob-in-repo>       skill dirs to copy (glob, may match many)
#   skip   <id> <skill-name>              never copy this skill from that source
#   rename <id> <old-name> <new-name>     copy under a new name; rewrite the
#                                         frontmatter name and /old or `old`
#                                         references inside that source's skills
#
# A skill dir is copied verbatim (minus .DS_Store) and REPLACES the existing
# dir of that name in agents/skills. Local edits to vendored skills are
# therefore lost on the next run: express them as rename/skip here, or as a
# patch in scripts/agents/vendor_skills.sh.

# Matt Pocock's engineering skills (was the mattpocock-skills Claude plugin)
source mattpocock https://github.com/mattpocock/skills.git main
skill  mattpocock skills/engineering/*
skill  mattpocock skills/productivity/*
skill  mattpocock skills/in-progress/*
skill  mattpocock skills/misc/*
# `teach` in agents/skills is the Entire skill; keep Matt's out of the way
skip   mattpocock teach
# `code-review` would shadow Claude Code's built-in /code-review (ultra mode)
rename mattpocock code-review mp-code-review

# Anthropic's official single-skill plugins
source anthropic https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official.git main
skill  anthropic plugins/frontend-design/skills/frontend-design
skill  anthropic plugins/skill-creator/skills/skill-creator

# TypeSafe
source typesafe https://github.com/typesafe-ai/skills.git main
skill  typesafe skills/typesafe-ai

# i-have-adhd
source adhd https://github.com/ayghri/i-have-adhd.git main
skill  adhd skills/i-have-adhd
